  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 1611.01 Requirements for Certification Renewal",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 1611.01 Requirements for Certification Renewal. A principal operator or assistant operator who is certified under this chapter who wishes to retain their certification shall:\n\n(a) Obtain continuing professional development hours as specified in Env-Sw 1611.02; and\n\n(b) Submit a completed, signed \"Solid Waste Facility Operator Certification Renewal Application,\" NHDES-S-05-038, April 2023, available at: https://onlineforms.nh.gov/?formtag=nhdes-s-05-038 as specified in Env-Sw 1611.03 with the fee as specified in Env-Sw 1611.04, no more than 90 days before the expiration date of the applicant’s current certification and within 90 days after the expiration date.\n\nSource. #10600, eff 7-1-14; ss by #13623, eff 5-1-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-sw1600.html"
